I think the NPE with this query


```
FROM employees
| INLINESTATS max_salary = MAX(salary) by languages 
| KEEP emp_no, languages, max_salary
```

is due to [PhysicalPlanOptimizer.ProjectAwayColumns](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/blob/main/x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/optimizer/PhysicalPlanOptimizer.java#L122-L127).
In this case, `rhs` and `lhs` contain the same fields, so removing one of the two we also remove the other one (that we'll need later in the planning).

We could fix it by just checking that we are not removing something we still need, eg.

```
if (p instanceof HashJoinExec join) {
    attributes.removeAll(join.addedFields());
    for (Attribute rhs : join.rightFields()) {
        if (join.leftFields().stream().anyMatch(x -> x.semanticEquals(rhs)) == false) {
            attributes.remove(rhs);
        }
    }
}
```

